#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:661
msgid ""
"The shipping phone field may be forced as \"required\" if the billing "
"address section is displayed after the shipping address section, and the "
"billing phone field is set as \"required\". This is needed to ensure the "
"shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is "
"checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Kui arveaadressi osa kuvatakse pärast tarneaadressi osa ja arveaadressi "
"telefoninumbri väli on märgitud „kohustuslikuks“, võib tarneaadressi "
"telefoninumbri väli muutuda kohustuslikuks. See on vajalik selleks, et "
"tagada tarneaadressi kopeerimine arveaadressile, kui vastav valik on "
"märgitud; vastasel juhul ei pruugi klient suuda ostukorvi vormi täita."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:687
msgid ""
"The billing phone field may be forced as \"required\" if the billing "
"address section is displayed before the shipping address section, and the "
"shipping phone field is set as \"required\". This is needed to ensure the "
"shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is "
"checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Arve telefoninumbri väli võib muutuda kohustuslikuks, kui arve aadressi osa "
"kuvatakse enne tarneaadressi osa ja tarne telefoninumbri väli on määratud "
"kohustuslikuks. See on vajalik selleks, et tagada tarneaadressi kopeerimine "
"arve aadressile, kui see valik on märgitud; vastasel juhul ei pruugi klient "
"suuda ostukorvi vormi täita."

