msgstr ""
"Seda valikut hallatakse Fluid Checkoutis. Saad seda muuta menüüs „Fluid "
"Checkout > Kliendikontod”."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-wc-shipping.php:36
#. translators: %s: URL to the Fluid Checkout checkout settings page.
msgid ""
"This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. The shipping destination is "
"always set to \"Default to customer shipping address\" when Fluid Checkout "
"is activated. Customers can still provide different shipping and billing "
"addresses during checkout.<br><br>An option for setting the default billing "
"address to be the same as the shipping address is available in the <a "
"href=\"%s\">Fluid Checkout settings</a>."
msgstr ""
"Seda valikut hallatakse Fluid Checkoutis. Kui Fluid Checkout on "
"aktiveeritud, on saatmiskohaks alati määratud „Vaikimisi kliendi "
"saatmisadresse”. Kliendid saavad kassasse minnes siiski sisestada erinevad "
"tarne- ja arveldusadressid.<br><br>Võimalus määrata vaikimisi "
"arveldusadressiks sama aadress, mis on tarneaadress, on saadaval <a "
"href=\"%s\">Fluid Checkouti seadetes</a>."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-wc-shipping.php:39
msgid ""
"This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. The shipping destination is "
"always set to \"Default to customer shipping address\" when Fluid Checkout "
"is activated. Customers can still provide different shipping and billing "
"addresses during checkout.<br><br>An option for setting the default billing "
"address to be the same as the shipping address is available at WooCommerce "
"> Settings > Fluid Checkout."
msgstr ""
"Seda valikut hallatakse Fluid Checkoutis. Kui Fluid Checkout on "
"aktiveeritud, on tarne sihtkoht alati seatud valikule „Vaikimisi kliendi "
"tarneaadress“. Kliendid saavad kassasse minnes siiski sisestada erinevad "
"tarne- ja arveldusadressid.<br><br>Võimalus määrata vaikimisi "
"arveldusadressiks sama aadress, mis on tarneaadress, on saadaval menüüs "
"WooCommerce > Seaded > Fluid Checkout."

#: inc/admin/admin-tab-fluid-checkout.php:104
